scenario: LOCK-01
title: Lock screen and automatic lock
area: Security
rows: F-LOCK-01, F-LOCK-03
machines: any
needs: person
prereq: Signed in with a password.
step: Press Super+L (Control+Command+L on the Mac profile).
expect: The screen is covered by a password prompt and apps keep running behind it.
clause: F-LOCK-01.lock
step: Type a wrong password.
expect: A plain message says it was wrong and the screen stays locked.
clause: F-LOCK-01.wrong
step: Type the right password.
expect: The screen opens on exactly what you had open.
clause: F-LOCK-01.unlock
step: In Settings choose automatic lock after 5 minutes, then leave the keyboard alone for 5 minutes.
expect: The screen locks by itself after about five minutes.
clause: F-LOCK-03.auto
